  "findings": [
    "ISBlacksmithMenu local disableFurnaceAnvil=true blocks the constructor menu callbacks. Existing BSFurnace object interaction remains a different branch.",
    "ISAnvil.create sets object name Anvil. RecipeManager.isNearItem compares Recipe.NearItem with nearby IsoObject.getName; sprite appearance alone is insufficient.",
    "SmithingMag1-4 declare learned recipes and are hidden in ISLiteratureUI. No matching active distribution entry was found in the inspected Lua corpus; absence of a text hit is not a world reachability proof.",
    "doMetalWorkerRecipes defines 40 free recipe assignments, but its three source call sites are commented out. The definition alone grants no profession recipe.",
    "IsoObject class factory recognizes StoneFurnace and constructs BSFurnace during object reconstruction; this is serialization support and establishes no standard-world spawn.",
    "Installed readable media text was searched for Anvil/Stone Furnace/crafted_01_19/crafted_01_42. No alternate active creation callback was found. Binary default-world map placement and named-object creation were not decoded, and survival gameplay was not exercised.",
    "Retain current admitted forging facts without treating declarations as proven survival availability. All 16 wording candidates remain explicitly unresolved in this audit. No absent count target or forced substitute purpose is used."
  ]
}
